BEHAVIOR total-len

DESCRIPTION
  Computes total output length: header (42) + body_len.
  Header = 19-byte timestamp + 23-byte " PROCESSED BY CONSUMER\n".

CONTRACT
  INPUT body_len int 8
  OUTPUT total int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH 8fd4b0c9

IMPLEMENTATION
  bl = LOAD body_len 8
  t1 = IADD bl 42 8
  STORE total t1 8
END
